# Protocols Micro-UI Implementation Plan

This plan outlines the steps to complete the telemetry protocols management system, including the visual protocol designer and the management of manufacturers, brands, and models.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The visual designer will use a simplified connection logic where users click on an output port and then an input port to create connections.
> Node types (Root, Service, Frame, Field) will have strict connection rules as specified in the requirements.

